[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13800.389, "timestamp": "03:50:00", "text": "我自己和一切，并联系"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13802.55, "timestamp": "03:50:02", "text": "各位，安排好一切，写下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13805.15, "timestamp": "03:50:05", "text": "一切都在某个地方向下沉沦。所以当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13809.51, "timestamp": "03:50:09", "text": "设想未来如果我这样做会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13811.91, "timestamp": "03:50:11", "text": "我应该这样做吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13814.95, "timestamp": "03:50:14", "text": "我和这些人一起完成了这次 Joathon 活动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13818.15, "timestamp": "03:50:18", "text": "就像我们已经完成了大约20个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13821.429, "timestamp": "03:50:21", "text": "此外，人们还可以合作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13824.229, "timestamp": "03:50:24", "text": "所以我就想，是啊，我很乐意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13826.469, "timestamp": "03:50:26", "text": "但我也想给他们更多机会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13828.83, "timestamp": "03:50:28", "text": "我无法理解的人是如何进入这个系统的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13832.95, "timestamp": "03:50:32", "text": "乔森对，因为如果你……如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13835.11, "timestamp": "03:50:35", "text": "你再次这样做，并且想要合作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13836.469, "timestamp": "03:50:36", "text": "和老人们在一起。那将是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13838.15, "timestamp": "03:50:38", "text": "太好了，你知道，因为，是的，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13839.75, "timestamp": "03:50:39", "text": "好的。是的。就像它有点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13842.55, "timestamp": "03:50:42", "text": "回想起人们第一次……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13844.15, "timestamp": "03:50:44", "text": "你知道，当时在场的那些人，第一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13846.229, "timestamp": "03:50:46", "text": "时间过去了，现在他们又回来了，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13849.189, "timestamp": "03:50:49", "text": "是啊，那太好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13852.469, "timestamp": "03:50:52", "text": "我希望再次来到这里。是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13855.269, "timestamp": "03:50:55", "text": "希望你下次还能来。是的，"}, 